RESPONSE_MD = r"""# 03 - Automated Response and Integrations

## Active Response (Manager `ossec.conf`)

```xml
<active-response>
  <command>firewall-drop</command>
  <location>local</location>
  <rules_id>100001</rules_id>
  <timeout>600</timeout>
</active-response>
```

- Bound to **rule ID 100001**, not to a severity threshold, so only the designated detection can trigger containment.
- `location: local` -> the action is executed on the agent that generated the alert.
- `timeout: 600` -> the block is automatically removed after 10 minutes to limit false-positive impact.

